OL,3,GNEWSANearly 2,000 apply for parking
OL,4,Afine error refunds
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly 2,000 drivers in Surrey have
OL,7,Fapplied to be refunded for parking
OL,8,Ffines after a local authority admitted
OL,9,Fnot having the legal powers to issue
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FIn May, Elmbridge Borough Council (EBC)
OL,13,Fsaid more than 9,000 people had been
OL,14,Faffected by the mistake, which resulted
OL,15,Fin #300,000 of fines across 17 of its
OL,16,Fcar parks in Esher, Cobham, Hersham,
OL,17,FWalton-on-Thames and Weybridge.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
