OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANearly 2,000 apply for parking
OL,4,Afine error refunds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority discovered the error
OL,7,Fwhile updating its parking terms and
OL,8,Fconditions and subsequently launched a
OL,9,Fscheme allowing people to claim their
OL,10,Fmoney back.
OL,12,FSo far, according to EBC's website,
OL,13,F1,869 refunds have been paid from a
OL,14,Ftotal of 1,957 applications received,
OL,15,Fwith the remainder still in progress.
